/* Base UI's Menu as a popover (ui/popover.c): give it an id and open it with
   <button popovertarget="id">. Its items are MenuItem, MenuCommand,
   MenuCheck and MenuOption, with Submenu, MenuGroup and MenuSeparator; the
   pointer, the arrow keys and typeahead highlight them, and Enter or a click
   runs one. Where it is written it takes no room. */
body { position: absolute; }
